# Only needed locally to run `npm run generate:audio` — never deployed, and
# never read by the site itself (there is no backend). See README.md's
# "Natural voice narration (ElevenLabs)" section.
#
# Get a key at https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys. Scope it to
# text-to-speech only — the script needs nothing else.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Optional overrides; both already match the script's defaults, so leaving
# them commented out changes nothing. The voice is "Janet", approved by the
# owner on 2026-07-25 as the site's canonical narration voice — changing it
# needs a fresh listen-through, not just an edit here. `eleven_turbo_v2_5` is
# a good latency/cost/quality balance.
ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=eLDc7xhWxG2FElT3kUTj
ELEVENLABS_MODEL_ID=eleven_turbo_v2_5
